    <briefdescription>
<para>A local orbital frame factory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Creates local orbital reference frames (e.g., LVLH, TNW, QSW, VNC, NED) from a given state (position and velocity). The factory generates frames on demand, parameterized by a parent frame and a frame type. </para>
